     * Powers the WhatsApp-profile-style media gallery on the contact-detail page. Covers every media
     * category — images, video, audio, voice notes, AND documents/files (nothing is filtered out).
     * Each item carries a short-lived (60 min) signed VIEW url into the private media bucket plus,
