    /**
     * Upload Contact Avatar.
     *
     * Upload a profile picture for a contact.
     *
     * The image is downscaled to 256px and stored in our own bucket, then served from the permanent
     * /api/v1/public/avatar/... proxy. A manually uploaded avatar is marked avatar_is_custom and is
     * NEVER overwritten by the channel's own profile picture — remove it (DELETE this endpoint) to
     * let platform syncing resume.
     *
     * Scopes: contacts:update.
     *
     * @param  ?string  $idempotencyKey  Repeat a request safely: SendSeven answers a repeat with the first result. One is generated when omitted.
     *
     * @throws ApiException
     *
     * @see https://api.sendseven.com/api/v1/docs#/Contacts/upload_contact_avatar_api_v1_contacts__contact_id__avatar_post
