    /**
     * Create Contact Method.
     *
     * Add a new contact method to a contact.
     *
     * Creates a new external identifier (phone, email, platform ID) linked to this contact. For
     * page-scoped types (messenger_id, instagram_id), a channel_id is required.
     *
     * If the proposed method's (method_type, value, channel_id) already belongs to a *different*
     * contact, this endpoint NEVER silently merges. Instead it returns HTTP 409 with a
     * machine-readable detail: "duplicate_contact_method" body so the frontend can prompt the user to
     * either merge the two contacts or open the other contact.
     *
     * Scopes: contacts:update.
     *
     * @param  string  $methodType  Type: phone, email, whatsapp_id, whatsapp_bsuid, telegram_id, messenger_id, instagram_id, linkedin, homepage, facebook, instagram_handle, social_other
     * @param  string  $value  The external identifier value
